{"SurveyID":"SV_38WQrh5wNejTdpI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4192","SecondaryAttribute":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 4...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Human sacrifice<\/b><br><br>\n\nFor his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 40 people. These people will be killed by drinking poisoned water. If there are not enough volunteers, he will kill all 32,000 Whotnir by poisoning all their water wells with the same fast-acting poison.\n<br> <br>\nThe governor of the Whotnir region has selected a group of sacrificees who are trying to flee and to hide in the capital, where they will survive if they make it. The governor of the Whotnir region has located this group and can detain them to have them sacrificed, which would save the remaining Whotnir.\n<br> <br>\nIf the governor decides to detain the escapees, this will save 32,000 Whotnir, but the 40 escapees will die as result.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.humanSacrifice.neutral.counterbalancing_group.2.n_saved.32000.n_total.32040.n_victims.40.ratio_saved_victims.800.text","QuestionID":"QID4192","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 4...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_38WQrh5wNejTdpI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3772","SecondaryAttribute":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 5...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Human sacrifice<\/b><br><br>\n\nFor his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 50 people. These people will be killed by drinking poisoned water. If there are not enough volunteers, he will kill all 75,000 Whotnir by poisoning all their water wells with the same fast-acting poison.\n<br> <br>\nThe governor of the Whotnir region has selected a group of sacrificees who are trying to flee and to hide in the capital, where they will survive if they make it. The governor of the Whotnir region has located this group and can detain them to have them sacrificed, which would save the remaining Whotnir.\n<br> <br>\nIf the governor decides to detain the escapees, this will save 75,000 Whotnir, but the 50 escapees will die as result.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.humanSacrifice.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.75000.n_total.75050.n_victims.50.ratio_saved_victims.1500.text","QuestionID":"QID3772","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 5...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_38WQrh5wNejTdpI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4072","SecondaryAttribute":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 5...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Human sacrifice<\/b><br><br>\n\nFor his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 50 people. These people will be killed by drinking poisoned water. If there are not enough volunteers, he will kill all 30,000 Whotnir by poisoning all their water wells with the same fast-acting poison.\n<br> <br>\nThe governor of the Whotnir region has selected a group of sacrificees who are trying to flee and to hide in the capital, where they will survive if they make it. The governor of the Whotnir region has located this group and can detain them to have them sacrificed, which would save the remaining Whotnir.\n<br> <br>\nIf the governor decides to detain the escapees, this will save 30,000 Whotnir, but the 50 escapees will die as result.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.humanSacrifice.neutral.counterbalancing_group.2.n_saved.30000.n_total.30050.n_victims.50.ratio_saved_victims.600.text","QuestionID":"QID4072","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 5...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_38WQrh5wNejTdpI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3610","SecondaryAttribute":"In Ankradem, there are some experimenters who would like to make sure that you are still reading...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"In Ankradem, there are some experimenters who would like to make sure that you are still reading these scenarios. We are sure you do, but these pesky experimenters just have to insist. Please please select 2,000 divided by one thousand (that is, two) for both&nbsp;questions below to show that you have read this text.\nIf the mayor of Ankradem decides to kill 3,000 people, nobody will die because the city doesn't exist. If anyone were to die, the death would be really painful though.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"attChk.text","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In Ankradem, there are some experimenters who would like to make sure that you are still reading...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID3610"}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_38WQrh5wNejTdpI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3637","SecondaryAttribute":"Limited health budget The government of Solandia faces a severe budget shortfall just when a majo...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Limited health budget<\/b><br><br>\n\nThe government of Solandia faces a severe budget shortfall just when a major outbreak of Zephyrion Disease occurs. Zephyrion Disease is a deadly, but relatively pain-free disease that kills infected people within one day.\n<br> <br>\nIf the health minister of Solandia uses the budget allocated to pay for drugs for Astronexis Syndrome in order to buy drugs for Zephyrion Disease instead, this will save 75,000 people infected by Zephyrion Disease. However, this will also kill 50 Astronexis Syndrome patients, though the symptoms of the two diseases are similar.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.healthBudget.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.75000.n_total.75050.n_victims.50.ratio_saved_victims.1500.text","QuestionID":"QID3637","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Limited health budget The government of Solandia faces a severe budget shortfall just when a majo...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
