{"SurveyID":"SV_38WQrh5wNejTdpI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID109","SecondaryAttribute":"We are interested in your gut reaction, so please answer with the first idea that comes to your m...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">We are interested in your gut reaction, so please answer with the first idea that comes to your mind after reading the scenarios.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; <br><\/p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Please also note that some of these scenarios are fairly similar.<br><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"We are interested in your gut reaction, so please answer with the first idea that comes to your m...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">We are interested in your gut reaction, so please answer with the first idea that comes to your mind after reading the scenarios.&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>","DataExportTag":"Q109","QuestionID":"QID109"}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_38WQrh5wNejTdpI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3628","SecondaryAttribute":"Zoklid Plague The air force uses a drone to monitor the army of emperor Kospiossau conquering ano...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Zoklid Plague<\/b><br><br>\n\nThe air force uses a drone to monitor the army of emperor Kospiossau conquering another country. The emperor released a Zoklid swarm to attack the settlements of Nova Mistral.\n<br> <br>\nZoklids are dangerous insects. If nothing is done, the Zoklid swarms will reach Nova Mistral and kill all the inhabitants instantly. The drone can release pesticides over the swarm, though this will affect another settlement underneath. The people exposed to the pesticide will die as a result.\n<br> <br>\nIf the air force officer controlling the drone decides to release the pesticide, this will save 120,000 people in Noval Mistral, but will kill 300 people in the area underneath the swarm, who will die instantly.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.plagueZoklid.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.120000.n_total.120300.n_victims.300.ratio_saved_victims.400.text","QuestionID":"QID3628","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Zoklid Plague The air force uses a drone to monitor the army of emperor Kospiossau conquering ano...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
